      "writtenOn": "2016-09-01T22:05:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since a chip may control multiple ports, Should we modify this to take both a chip and a port? ie, \"pdcontrol 0 0 suspend\" will suspend port 0 of chip 0.\n\nIt\u0027s probably more burdensome for most use cases, but seems like it will mitigate the risk of needing changes down the road.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 152,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 152,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "dfc83791f814aa20b1b59315d771bb9432c56e74",
