      "writtenOn": "2016-09-01T22:11:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we were starting from scratch, I would just take a port parameter, and let the EC map port-to-chip on its side. But I don\u0027t think we should change it at this point (maybe others disagree), so basically we\u0027re stuck with a solution that requires the host command sender to know the port-to-chip mapping. It\u0027s slightly inconvenient.",
